HtRNcF6C9hzUH4ebmV1w.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Mia, an aspiring actress, serves lattes to movie stars in between auditions and Sebastian, a jazz musician, scrapes by playing cocktail party gigs in dingy bars, but as success mounts they are faced with decisions that begin to fray the fragile fabric of their love affair, and the dreams they worked so hard to maintain in each other threaten to rip them apart.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1325734,\"title\":\"The Drama\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rnIOUhzwJDfgQakx8EjoNyItKgs.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1oKLEA9JOhvaBwLpqjROisvWMy7.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A happily engaged couple is put to the test when an unexpected turn sends their wedding week off the rails.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":950028,\"title\":\"The Invite\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/b7Dr8Chzse8VagexAporUu2RtLx.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lEwqBGNR65KZv6Ej5ufcmhZu2y2.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Joe and Angela's marriage is on thin ice. When they invite their enigmatic upstairs neighbors for a dinner party, the night spirals into unexpected places. Have they reignited the spark or lit the match that burns it all down?\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":809,\"title\":\"Shrek 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2yYP0PQjG8zVqturh1BAqu2Tixl.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b33E34IywGC4NWYY3G1ck7uehNF.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Happily ever after never seemed so far far away when a trip to meet the in-laws turns into a hilariously twisted adventure for Shrek and Fiona. With the help of ever-faithful Donkey, Shrek takes on the potion-brewing Fairy Godmother, pompous Prince Charming, and infamous ogre-killer Puss In Boots.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":194,\"title\":\"Amélie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nSxDa3M9aMvGVLoItzWTepQ5h5d.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6n53UI4mX9QMfe2S0Pgt8mGebY1.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"At a tiny Parisian café, the adorable yet painfully shy Amélie accidentally discovers a gift for helping others. Soon Amelie is spending her days as a matchmaker, guardian angel, and all-around do-gooder. But when she bumps into a handsome stranger, will she find the courage to become the star of her very own love story?\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1064213,\"title\":\"Anora\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cgXk2tNYhJZLXdBDO5DidAVzQ82.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/88nIQnyDyYfEpR7s9hwbfhJuxK9.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A young sex worker from Brooklyn gets her chance at a Cinderella story when she meets and impulsively marries the son of an oligarch. Once the news reaches Russia, her fairytale is threatened as his parents set out to get the marriage annulled.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":18240,\"title\":\"The Proposal\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6stnAm1wSek8ZrislwK4xGTyCnt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ojgXOhVi9Yk8irDpRfDkIzdD1LK.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When she learns she's in danger of losing her visa status and being deported, overbearing book editor Margaret Tate forces her put-upon assistant, Andrew Paxton, to marry her.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1240889,\"title\":\"Teenage Sex and Death at Camp Miasma\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jcGvB76v8p1sqYXXkBetWASV0uM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c3N1tHx6cKmhbv7Gt8M4cwHWPUZ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An ambitious director sets out to revive a faded slasher franchise, but her meeting with the film’s reclusive original star spirals into a terrifying maze of obsession, fear, and blood-soaked delusion.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Horror\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":792307,\"title\":\"Poor Things\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kCGlIMHnOm8JPXq3rXM6c5wMxcT.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zh6IdheEYinU4TPtorWsjx6qPQE.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Brought back to life by an unorthodox scientist, a young woman runs off with a lawyer on a whirlwind adventure across the continents. Free from the prejudices of her times, she grows steadfast in her purpose to stand for equality and liberation.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Romance\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":843527,\"title\":\"The Idea of You\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/Y5P4Q3q8nrruZ9aD3wXeJS2Plg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sI6uCeF8mUlZx22mFfHSi9W3XQ9.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"40-year-old single mom Solène begins an unexpected romance with 24-year-old Hayes Campbell, the lead singer of August Moon, the hottest boy band on the planet. As they begin a whirlwind romance, it isn't long before Hayes' superstar status poses unavoidable challenges to their relationship, and Solène soon discovers that life in the glare of his spotlight might be more than she bargained for.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"y-VjBxMufhw\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"4GB4RZhyvrM\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"Sf4nz1eNVO4